# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (context = repository root).
# Keep every .env out of the images: apps/web/.env would bake VITE_DEMO_CREDENTIALS into the SPA bundle.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
apps/api/data
docs
# The web image serves the threat model at /SECURITY.md (apps/web/Dockerfile).
!docs/SECURITY.md
*.log
.vscode
.idea
